    note = "CORE ARGUMENT: Argues that with the collapse of Communism Marxism's critique of capitalism is more timely, and renews historical materialism against postmodern fragmentation and teleological readings. MARX-CENTRALITY: Main topic: reconstruction of Marx's historical materialism (title does not name Marx).",
