    title = "Vulgar economy in Marxian garb: a critique of Temporal Single System Marxism",
    journal = "Review of Radical Political Economics",
    year = "2002",
    volume = "34",
    note = "Criticises Temporal Single System Marxism, arguing that Marx did make errors in his transformation algorithm but that these do not undermine his labour theory of value, and that the TSS defence is vulgar economy. MARX-CENTRALITY: Title: Marxian value theory; the main topic is a critique of the TSS interpretation.",
